NAME
     less - look at a file a screen at a time

SYNOPSIS
     less [-N] [-S] [-e] [+N] [FILE...]
     more [FILE...]

DESCRIPTION
     less shows FILE a screen at a time. Space and f go forward, b back,
     j and k a line at a time, g and G to the start and the end, /PATTERN
     searches, n repeats the search, and q leaves. Called as more it
     behaves as that command does.

OPTIONS
     -N   number the lines
     -S   do not wrap long lines
     -e   leave at the end of the file rather than waiting
     +N   start at line N

SEE ALSO
     cat(1), head(1), tail(1)
